      "quote": "二十五年，封淮陽王",
      "sha256": "a4a72e52fc502f1fc8c275a54343ca8c594e57286f51496a6f18eb44425e8a05",
      "note": "明帝彧先封。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/song008-ws2309997.wikitext",
      "line": 2,
      "start": 59,
      "quote": "二十九年，改封湘東王",
      "sha256": "a4a72e52fc502f1fc8c275a54343ca8c594e57286f51496a6f18eb44425e8a05",
      "note": "改封夫君時間。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/songshu/song008-ws2309997.wikitext",
      "line": 20,
      "start": 607,
      "quote": "戊寅，崇太后為崇憲皇太后。立皇后王氏",
      "sha256": "a4a72e52fc502f1fc8c275a54343ca8c594e57286f51496a6f18eb44425e8a05",
      "note": "二人：崇太后事與王皇后之立各有所屬。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi011-ws2288359.wikitext",
      "line": 74,
      "start": 169,
      "quote": "后兄揚州刺史景文以此事語從舅陳郡謝綽",
      "sha256": "056a4790420554786f40b92b14255aeec0a0eb168722bfeda19ad5f78f6363d4",
      "note": "南11異作謝綽。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi011-ws2288359.wikitext",
      "line": 76,
      "start": 120,
      "quote": "宗室劉晃、劉綽、卜伯興等有異志",
      "sha256": "056a4790420554786f40b92b14255aeec0a0eb168722bfeda19ad5f78f6363d4",
      "note": "南11與宋41同，並無分案細節。"
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi011-ws2288359.wikitext",
      "line": 76,
      "start": 200,
      "quote": "追加諡，葬以宋禮",
      "sha256": "056a4790420554786f40b92b14255aeec0a0eb168722bfeda19ad5f78f6363d4",
      "note": "南11不報卒齡及明諡。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2069101.wikitext",
      "line": 72,
      "start": 11,
      "quote": "名與明帝諱同",
      "sha256": "69128313de5d9e3a6bec92be7457d6749458b0c862ee563e22cd8e4dcb0392ea",
      "note": "王景文本名彧，沿用既有1tc_q18_x7v。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2069101.wikitext",
      "line": 72,
      "start": 192,
      "quote": "父僧朗",
      "sha256": "69128313de5d9e3a6bec92be7457d6749458b0c862ee563e22cd8e4dcb0392ea",
      "note": "景文父。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2069101.wikitext",
      "line": 74,
      "start": 38,
      "quote": "故為太宗娶景文妹",
      "sha256": "69128313de5d9e3a6bec92be7457d6749458b0c862ee563e22cd8e4dcb0392ea",
      "note": "景文之妹為明帝妻。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2312005.wikitext",
      "line": 17,
      "start": 283,
      "quote": "中領軍劉韞、直閤將軍卜伯興在殿內同謀",
      "sha256": "a480369ee03a0a587c7ff2ca0d63cfddf14d3a9aed3a0cfd679e9d64c3b06b54",
      "note": "昇明元年十二月，卜伯興與劉韞，非劉晃。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2312005.wikitext",
      "line": 40,
      "start": 22,
      "quote": "癸亥，臨澧侯劉晃謀反",
      "sha256": "a480369ee03a0a587c7ff2ca0d63cfddf14d3a9aed3a0cfd679e9d64c3b06b54",
      "note": "昇明二年十一月；官爵與墓誌晃的桂陽侯不合。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2312005.wikitext",
      "line": 49,
      "start": 110,
      "quote": "庚戌，臨川王綽謀反，綽及黨與皆伏誅",
      "sha256": "a480369ee03a0a587c7ff2ca0d63cfddf14d3a9aed3a0cfd679e9d64c3b06b54",
      "note": "昇明三年三月庚戌，臨川王綽，與晃異人。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/qi2-ws2312009.wikitext",
      "line": 11,
      "start": 0,
      "quote": "建元元年夏四月甲午，上即皇帝位於南郊",
      "sha256": "336ce89c3a62671c73192ac1c3d91e5cde2cdd7d42568bf624058bf70805ce9e",
      "note": "蕭道成建齊。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/qi2-ws2312009.wikitext",
      "line": 21,
      "start": 464,
      "quote": "己未，汝陰王薨，追謚為宋順帝",
      "sha256": "336ce89c3a62671c73192ac1c3d91e5cde2cdd7d42568bf624058bf70805ce9e",
      "note": "亡者宋順帝，齊建元元年五月。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/qi2-ws2312009.wikitext",
      "line": 29,
      "start": 0,
      "quote": "冬十月丙子，立彭城劉胤為汝陰王",
      "sha256": "336ce89c3a62671c73192ac1c3d91e5cde2cdd7d42568bf624058bf70805ce9e",
      "note": "同月立新汝陰王。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/qi2-ws2312009.wikitext",
      "line": 29,
      "start": 204,
      "quote": "汝陰太妃王氏薨，追贈為宋恭皇后",
      "sha256": "336ce89c3a62671c73192ac1c3d91e5cde2cdd7d42568bf624058bf70805ce9e",
      "note": "貞風十月卒，追贈宋恭皇后。本紀未在此另署卒日。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/song51-ws1959959.wikitext",
      "line": 27,
      "start": 0,
      "quote": "道憐六子：義欣、義慶、義融",
      "sha256": "9d7e879eec7995f066f0ba7740b3433e96b5b3336d693988c35b9416d2f75a4c",
      "note": "道憐生義慶、義融；道規後嗣另論。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/song51-ws1959959.wikitext",
      "line": 83,
      "start": 33,
      "quote": "無子，弟襲以子晃繼封",
      "sha256": "9d7e879eec7995f066f0ba7740b3433e96b5b3336d693988c35b9416d2f75a4c",
      "note": "劉晃親父襲、承繼伯父覬。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/song51-ws1959959.wikitext",
      "line": 87,
      "start": 79,
      "quote": "改封臨澧縣侯",
      "sha256": "9d7e879eec7995f066f0ba7740b3433e96b5b3336d693988c35b9416d2f75a4c",
      "note": "劉襲封臨澧。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/song51-ws1959959.wikitext",
      "line": 181,
      "start": 0,
      "quote": "子哀王燁字景舒嗣",
      "sha256": "9d7e879eec7995f066f0ba7740b3433e96b5b3336d693988c35b9416d2f75a4c",
      "note": "臨川哀王燁（南13作曄）。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/song51-ws1959959.wikitext",
      "line": 181,
      "start": 28,
      "quote": "子綽字子流嗣",
      "sha256": "9d7e879eec7995f066f0ba7740b3433e96b5b3336d693988c35b9416d2f75a4c",
      "note": "綽父燁。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2268660.wikitext",
      "line": 24,
      "start": 52,
      "quote": "子孝侯覬嗣，無子，弟襲以子晃繼",
      "sha256": "d521d68579cdbcd873028edaf1691f3e11ef929b9d6a51de889b8d983c924fff",
      "note": "覬、襲兄弟及出繼。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2268660.wikitext",
      "line": 51,
      "start": 73,
      "quote": "曄子綽嗣",
      "sha256": "d521d68579cdbcd873028edaf1691f3e11ef929b9d6a51de889b8d983c924fff",
      "note": "曄、燁異體各存。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2581953.wikitext",
      "line": 119,
      "start": 2,
      "quote": "父讳义融，字义融",
      "sha256": "5d7df1147636f9cb7140d95693aed2eaa0d0d64deee744a945e81e817a5014b7",
      "note": "清嚴可均所輯墓誌轉錄，數位固定簡體用字存原形。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2581953.wikitext",
      "line": 143,
      "start": 2,
      "quote": "第一男晃长晖，出後兄，绍封桂阳侯，第二男旻渊高，拜临沣侯世子",
      "sha256": "5d7df1147636f9cb7140d95693aed2eaa0d0d64deee744a945e81e817a5014b7",
      "note": "晃出後兄及封桂陽侯；旻為臨灃侯世子。與紀書晃臨澧侯並列。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/song041-wang-family/external/ws2581953.wikitext",
      "line": 149,
      "start": 2,
      "quote": "君讳袭，字茂德，南彭城人",
      "sha256": "5d7df1147636f9cb7140d95693aed2eaa0d0d64deee744a945e81e817a5014b7",
      "note": "同誌之主；未核拓本，錄作傳世錄文。"
    }
  ],
