      "start": 29,
      "end": 41,
      "surface": "太宗改封，又為湘東王妃。",
      "interpretation": "改湘東與校補。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p001",
      "first_line": 272,
      "start": 41,
      "end": 58,
      "surface": "生晉陵長公主伯姒、建安長公主伯媛。",
      "interpretation": "二女。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p001",
      "first_line": 272,
      "start": 58,
      "end": 68,
      "surface": "太宗即位，立為皇后。",
      "interpretation": "夫即位，立后。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p002",
      "first_line": 274,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19,
      "surface": "上嘗宮內大集，而臝婦人觀之，以為歡笑。",
      "interpretation": "見臝婦之集，帝觀而笑。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p002",
      "first_line": 274,
      "start": 19,
      "end": 30,
      "surface": "后以扇障面，獨無所言。",
      "interpretation": "以扇障面不言。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p002",
      "first_line": 274,
      "start": 30,
      "end": 53,
      "surface": "帝怒曰：「外舍家寒乞，今共為笑樂，何獨不視？」",
      "interpretation": "明帝責王家。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p002",
      "first_line": 274,
      "start": 53,
      "end": 101,
      "surface": "后曰：「為樂之事，其方自多。豈有姑姊妹集聚，而臝婦人形體。以此為樂，外舍之為歡適，實與此不同。」",
      "interpretation": "答姑姊妹會不應如此。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p002",
      "first_line": 274,
      "start": 101,
      "end": 110,
      "surface": "帝大怒，遣后令起。",
      "interpretation": "令后起。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p002",
      "first_line": 274,
      "start": 110,
      "end": 152,
      "surface": "后兄揚州刺史景文以此事語從舅陳郡謝緯曰：「后在家為儜弱婦人，不知今段遂能剛正如此。」",
      "interpretation": "景文轉告從舅謝緯。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p003",
      "first_line": 276,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 16,
      "surface": "廢帝即位，尊為皇太后，宮曰弘訓。",
      "interpretation": "劉昱即位尊太后，宮號弘訓。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p003",
      "first_line": 276,
      "start": 16,
      "end": 45,
      "surface": "廢帝失德，太后每加勗譬，始者猶見順從，後狂慝轉甚，漸不悅。",
      "interpretation": "太后早期勗譬。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p003",
      "first_line": 276,
      "start": 45,
      "end": 78,
      "surface": "元徽五年五月五日，太后賜帝玉柄毛扇，帝嫌其毛柄不華，因此欲加酖害，",
      "interpretation": "五月初五贈扇，帝嫌之。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p003",
      "first_line": 276,
      "start": 78,
      "end": 114,
      "surface": "已令太醫煑藥，左右人止之曰：「若行此事，官便應作孝子，豈復得出入狡獪。」",
      "interpretation": "左右諫止。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p003",
      "first_line": 276,
      "start": 114,
      "end": 128,
      "surface": "帝曰：「汝語大有理。」乃止。",
      "interpretation": "帝納言，事止。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 10,
      "surface": "順帝即位，齊王秉權，",
      "interpretation": "齊王秉權。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 10,
      "end": 33,
      "surface": "宗室劉晃、劉綽、卜伯興等有異志，太后頗與相關。",
      "interpretation": "劉晃、劉綽、卜伯興，后頗與相關。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 33,
      "end": 61,
      "surface": "順帝禪位，太后與帝遜于東邸，因遷居丹陽宮，拜汝陰王太妃。",
      "interpretation": "遜東邸遷丹陽宮，拜汝陰王太妃。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 61,
      "end": 74,
      "surface": "順帝殂於丹陽，更立第京邑。",
      "interpretation": "宋順帝先卒，后京邑立第。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 74,
      "end": 89,
      "surface": "建元元年，薨于第，時年四十四。",
      "interpretation": "貞風薨，四十四。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 89,
      "end": 100,
      "surface": "追加號諡，葬以宋后禮。",
      "interpretation": "追號諡及宋后葬禮。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-041-wangzhenfeng:p004",
      "first_line": 278,
      "start": 100,
      "end": 111,
      "surface": "父僧朗，事別見景文傳。",
      "interpretation": "父及王景文傳互見。"
    }
  ],
  "edition_note_rows": [
    {
      "line": 272,
      "raw_start": 11549,
      "raw_end": 11624,
      "text": "太宗改封又為湘東王妃　各本並脫「又為」二字，據[[南史]]補。按太宗即明帝，初封淮陽王，{{YL|元嘉二十九年}}，改封湘東王，故其妃亦改稱湘東王妃。",
      "proposed_by": "數位整理者據南史補",
      "note": "又為二字數位校補，殿本作改封湘東王妃。"
    }
  ],
